      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process immediately before that process starts**. \n\nThe key points are:\n\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is injected **only into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process** (or Query agent process for the query agent)\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated with the credential\n- This means a compromised Hub process cannot leak the key by inspecting its own environment variables \u2014 the key exists only in the short-lived child process that actually needs it",
